WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.180
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: He is not allowed to

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.609
use SCP-705 for personal gain!

00:00:07.609 --> 00:00:11.530
The Play-Doh toy soldiers are highly entertaining
to watch, and it’s understandable to be

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:16.390
curious about their potential applications,
but Dr. Bright has taken it too far.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:20.510
He used the tiny soldiers to plant hidden
cameras and microphones in his colleague’s

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:21.510
offices.

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:25.950
Not only is this a violation of their privacy,
but it’s also just plain creepy, and it’s

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:30.160
unfair to make SCP-705 instances accomplices
to your bad behavior!

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:32.050
They didn’t know what they were signing
on to do, and if they’d known the hidden

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:36.910
surveillance equipment was intended for blackmail
or for stealing a secret lasagna recipe that’s

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:40.870
been in Dr. Giotta’s family for generations,
they never would have agreed.

